# # /provenance/
#
# Persistent identifiers for a CIDOC-CRM based provenance database
# (artworks, loose parts, artists, provenance features, modification processes,
# provenance chain with persons/corporate bodies, sources and places,
# controlled vocabularies).
#
#   https://w3id.org/provenance/{type}/{id}              records, id = 16 hex characters
#   https://w3id.org/provenance/vocab/{vocabulary}/{id}  vocabulary terms
#   https://w3id.org/provenance/ontology#{Term}          classes and properties
#
# Every request is forwarded unchanged to the project's own resolver, which
# does the content negotiation (HTML detail page / REST API) and knows the
# current location of every record. Moving the website or the API only
# changes the resolver, not this file. All redirects are 303 See Other.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# David Witassek
# david@witassek.ch
# GitHub username: dwitassek

Options -MultiViews
RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://id.bermuda-solutions.com/provenance/$1 [R=303,L]
